# Wave T35 (Lotus Cove kit): lotusroof — Lotus Cove City's own roof kind.
# LAVENDER BARREL TILE: overlapping courses of half-round tiles in the
# town style's own lavender (#9a7fb8 body, #bfa8d4 lit crowns, #66538a
# seams), courses scalloping every 4px, tile ends staggered course to
# course. Half-round scalloped courses are structurally unlike every
# shipped roof: Hushmoor's flat shingle rectangles, Blossom's sakura
# shingles, Copperton's copper-seamed slabs, Eldergrove's banded
# thatch, Fairhaven's stitched canvas, Wildflower's open trellis,
# Highbranch's leaf scales. Worn by the Contest Hall, the Department
# Store and the town's two facade cottages.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T35-LOTUSCOVE-PLAN.md.)
PIX tile-lotusroof 16 16
